1. Seal all three classes (trivial, immediate devirtualization win)
2. Fix `FixedLengthTruncator` line 72 (one-line span fix)
3. Rewrite `FixedNumberOfWordsTruncator` to avoid `Split`/LINQ entirely
4. Replace `Symbols` lookup with `SearchValues<char>`

